{
	"name": "Deadly Cantripper",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/unholy/strike-body-explode-disintegrate.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You continue to push yourself, learning more combat tactics, weapons, and ways to enhance your cantrips. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Dexterity, Constitution, or warcaster spellcasting ability score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain an expertise die to your Arcana skill. Your maximum expertise die size for Arcana increases to a d10.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with a martial weapon of your choice, or if you are already proficient with all martial weapons, a rare weapon of your choice.</p></li><li><p>Your critical range for attacks made as part of a cantrip increases by 1, to a maximum range of 17-20.</p></li><li><p>Whenever you score a critical hit with a cantrip, you can choose to apply the additional effect from Dangerous Cantripper to an allied creature within 30 instead of yourself.</p></li></ul>",
